OL,3,GNEWSAKing's hospital told to improve
OL,4,Aafter inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo services at King's College Hospital
OL,7,Fin south London have been rated as
OL,8,Frequiring improvement by the Care
OL,9,FQuality Commission (CQC).
OL,11,FInspectors reporting on the urgent and
OL,12,Femergency care unit said patients were
OL,13,Foften cared for in corridors because of
OL,14,Fa lack of space, sometimes for long
OL,15,Fperiods.
OL,17,FAt the children and young people unit,
OL,18,Fstaff did not always assess risks to
OL,19,Fpeople's health and safety or mitigate
OL,20,Fthem where identified, according to the
OL,21,FCQC.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
