OL,3,GNEWSAKing's hospital told to improve
OL,4,Aafter inspection
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing's College Hospital NHS Foundation
OL,7,FTrust, which runs the hospital, said
OL,8,Falthough inspectors had noted
OL,9,Fimprovements, despite demand for both
OL,10,Fservices being high, it had to "make
OL,11,Fsure we get the basics right".
